### Travel Content System — manual API smoke test collection
### Use with VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP Client.
### Set @baseUrl + @token below, then click "Send Request" above each block.
### Goal: every request returns a sane status (200/4xx) — never a 500.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = dev-bypass-token

### ── health ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### ── media ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### media: unknown id → expect 404 (NOT 500 — regression guard for .single())
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media/does-not-exist-00000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── posts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts?limit=10&sort=scheduled_desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### posts: reject unknown id → expect 404 (regression guard for v0.9.5 500)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/does-not-exist-00000000/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### posts: approve unknown id → expect 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/does-not-exist-00000000/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### posts: publish unknown id → expect 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/does-not-exist-00000000/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### posts: cancel unknown id → expect 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/does-not-exist-00000000/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### posts: retry-youtube unknown id → expect 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/does-not-exist-00000000/retry-youtube
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### posts: reschedule
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/does-not-exist-00000000/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scheduled_at": "2027-01-01T09:00:00+00:00", "window_minutes": 60 }

### posts: create from filter (story) → 200 pipeline_started, or 404 if none
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "strategy": "story" }

### posts: create best with missing fields → expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "strategy": "best", "country": "Japan" }

### ── pipeline ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pipeline/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### pipeline: unknown stage → expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pipeline/not-a-real-stage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── assets (LUT + intro/outro browsers) ─────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/luts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/intros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assets/outros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── settings / taxonomy / analytics ─────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/taxonomy/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── notifications ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/token-status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
